					"nextDialogs": [
						140221204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140221204,
					"content": "厄舍这家伙，还敢说我的用料有问题。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140221205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "千织"
				},
				{
					"id": 140221205,
					"content": "搞半天，是他自己开了个黑心工厂…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140221206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140221206,
					"content": "我说他做的衣服怎么摸起来怪怪的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140221207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "千织"
				},
				{
					"id": 140221207,
					"content": "原来是为了削减成本，偷偷在工厂里搞这些小动作…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140221208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "千织"
				},
				{
					"id": 140221208,
					"content": "这样做出来的衣服能穿吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140221209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140221209,
					"content": "褪色和缩水都是小事了，这不正规的用料…穿多了皮肤都要出问题。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140221210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "千织"
				},
				{
					"id": 140221210,
					"content": "好可怕…我们快把这些证据拍下来吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140221211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140221211,
					"content": "这样他在审判庭上就无话可说了！我们继续前进吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
